            "review_title": "Review at The Grande Steak",
            "review_text": "Glorevenhite V\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nDelicious Charcoal Steak with affordable price\nApr 2024 • Friends\nThe foods are actually delicious with affordable price. Quiet, polite staff. The restaurant need to be more recognized in Phu My Hung community\nInsider tip:\nStarters like Cappacio looks great. Price of wine is almost the same with store and restaurant wont charge corkage fee if order coldcut\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 16, 2024",
